---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro"
import Logo from "../assets/ajolotes.png"
import Footer from "./Footer.astro"
---

<article>

  <!-- links de redes sociales -->
   <div>
     <h1>
       <span>
         AWS User Group Ajolotes en la Nube
         <Image src={Logo} alt="A bird." width="72"  />
       </span>
     </h1>
     <Footer />
   </div>

  <p>
    Este grupo está enfocado en brindar apoyo y conocimiento sobre todo lo relacionado a AWS, es decir, aprenderás sobre el uso, la implementación y la optimización de los servicios de Amazon Web Services (AWS).

    Un grupo enfocado en AWS es un espacio de aprendizaje, colaboración y networking para aquellos interesados en aprovechar al máximo las capacidades y beneficios de la plataforma de Amazon Web Services.

    Y recuerda, somos el User Group oficial de AWS en la CDMX.
  </p>
</article>


<style>
  article {
    max-width: 800px;
    max-height: 800px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: 100%;

  }

  article h1 {
    font-size: 2.6rem;
  }

  article h1 span {
    display: block;
  }

  article p {
    white-space: pre-line;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-shadow: 0.4px 0.4px #fd8205;
  }

  article img {
    display: inline-block;
    position: relative;
    left: 12px;
    top: 8px;
    width: 48px;
    height: 55px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    article {
      padding-left: 54px;
      max-height: 85vh;
    }
    article h1 {
      font-size: 4rem;
    }

    article p {
      width: 60ch;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    article img {
      width: 72px;
      height: 83px;

      margin-left: 8px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  import gsap from "gsap";
  import { SplitText } from "gsap/SplitText";

  gsap.registerPlugin(SplitText);
  const split = new SplitText("h1 span", { type: "words", mask:"words", wordsClass: "word" });

  window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    gsap.from([split.words, "article img"], {
      duration: 1,
      opacity: 0,
      delay: 0.5,
      y: "100%",
      stagger: 0.1,
      ease: "power2.out",
    });
    gsap.from("article p", {
      duration: 1,
      opacity: 0,
      delay: 1.5,
      y: 50,
      ease: "power2.out",
      
    });

    gsap.from("article a", {
      duration: 1,
      opacity: 0,
      delay: 1,
      y: 50,
      ease: "power2.out",
      stagger: 0.1,
    });

    gsap.to([split.words, "article img"], {
      duration: 2,
      delay: 2.5,
      keyframes: {
        y: [0, 8,  0],
        color: ["#fff", "rgb(203,186,233)", "#fff"],
        ease: "power1.inOut"
      },
      stagger: 0.1,
      repeat: -1,
      repeatDelay: 1.5,
    });
  });

</script>